{
    "title": "Speak English with Praktika",
    "description": "People spend years trying to learn English, yet only 5% can speak it fluently.  With the Praktika English language learning app, you can immerse yourself in a groundbreaking English language learning experience with the help and support of 25 ultra-realistic, customized  AI avatar tutors from around the world.  Its 50x cheaper than a human and 100% real-time!\r\n\r\nOUR MISSION\r\n\r\nWe believe that learning a new language should be fun, engaging and accessible to everyone, so we\u2019re on a mission to empower the next billion English language learners to overcome barriers and seize new opportunities. With Praktika, you can unlock new career opportunities and break down language barriers, making the most of your skills and knowledge.\r\n\r\nWHY PRAKTIKA?\r\n\r\n1.        Learn from ultra-realistic avatars: Experience learning English with real-life personalities and engage in meaningful face to face conversations.\r\n\r\n2.        Access comprehensive courses:  Engage in 1000+ English lessons ranging from beginner to advanced including IELTS and TOEFL. \r\n\r\n3.        Discuss practical topics:  Explore 150+ real life topics from economic growth to architecture, pop culture and more. You'll never run out of intriguing subjects!\r\n\r\n4.        Engage with interactive content: Access unlimited, interactive content available anytime to boost your English grammar, pronunciation, vocabulary and even fluency speaking skills.\r\n\r\n5.        Enjoy a low-pressure environment: Practice role-plays and most importantly, feel at ease making mistakes in a supportive learning environment.\r\n\r\nPraktika avatars are more than just virtual figures; they're meticulously designed with unique backgrounds, stories and even accents to provide you with a truly immersive English learning experience.  Each A.I driven character acts as your personal English teacher or friendly partner in conversation, providing instant feedback and personalized guidance to elevate your English skills.\r\n\r\nMEET SOME OF THE TUTORS\r\n\r\n- Dwayne from the USA: He\u2019s a funny, smooth and engaging English tutor who loves sports!\r\n- Camilla from Australia: She\u2019s cool, confident and witty English tutor.  \r\n- Alisha from the USA: She is vibrant, enthusiastic English tutor and a Stanford University graduate.\r\n- Softly spoken Susan from Singapore:  She is an avid reader and also boasts a top-class education. \r\n- Alejandro from Spain:  He\u2019s an English tutor and a culinary enthusiast, which means you can ask him anything about tapas! \r\n- Marco from the USA: He\u2019s an English tutor, a journalist and an outdoor enthusiast.\r\n- Charlie - a charming English tutor from London. She\u2019s also an art lover and former journalist.\r\n\r\n....and many others.\r\n\r\nLEARN ABOUT \r\nArchitecture, art, business, car brands, cinema, cuisine, dance, economics, \r\neducation, entrepreneurship, environmental issues, famous landmarks, fashion, festivals, film, food, football rivalries, the football World Cup, geography, health care, history, immigration, influencers, literature, museums, music, natural wonders, Netflix, pop culture, Queen Elizabeth II, careers in I.T, relationships, finance, beauty, social media, fitness, transport, startups, new technologies, science, domestic animals, jobs and career, shopping, street art, technology, theatre tourism, tv shows, UFC, wildlife and many more\u2026\r\n\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Start your English language learning journey today with Praktika \u2013 the most practical and fun way to learn English!\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or need assistance, our team is always here to help. Simply reach out to us at support@praktika.ai.\r\n\r\nDownload Praktika today and join new era of English learners. \r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://praktika.ai/terms\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://praktika.ai/privacy",
    "descriptionHTML": "People spend years trying to learn English, yet only 5% can speak it fluently.  With the Praktika English language learning app, you can immerse yourself in a groundbreaking English language learning experience with the help and support of 25 ultra-realistic, customized  AI avatar tutors from around the world.  Its 50x cheaper than a human and 100% real-time!<br><br>OUR MISSION<br><br>We believe that learning a new language should be fun, engaging and accessible to everyone, so we\u2019re on a mission to empower the next billion English language learners to overcome barriers and seize new opportunities. With Praktika, you can unlock new career opportunities and break down language barriers, making the most of your skills and knowledge.<br><br>WHY PRAKTIKA?<br><br>1.        Learn from ultra-realistic avatars: Experience learning English with real-life personalities and engage in meaningful face to face conversations.<br><br>2.        Access comprehensive courses:  Engage in 1000+ English lessons ranging from beginner to advanced including IELTS and TOEFL. <br><br>3.        Discuss practical topics:  Explore 150+ real life topics from economic growth to architecture, pop culture and more. You&#39;ll never run out of intriguing subjects!<br><br>4.        Engage with interactive content: Access unlimited, interactive content available anytime to boost your English grammar, pronunciation, vocabulary and even fluency speaking skills.<br><br>5.        Enjoy a low-pressure environment: Practice role-plays and most importantly, feel at ease making mistakes in a supportive learning environment.<br><br>Praktika avatars are more than just virtual figures; they&#39;re meticulously designed with unique backgrounds, stories and even accents to provide you with a truly immersive English learning experience.  Each A.I driven character acts as your personal English teacher or friendly partner in conversation, providing instant feedback and personalized guidance to elevate your English skills.<br><br>MEET SOME OF THE TUTORS<br><br>- Dwayne from the USA: He\u2019s a funny, smooth and engaging English tutor who loves sports!<br>- Camilla from Australia: She\u2019s cool, confident and witty English tutor.  <br>- Alisha from the USA: She is vibrant, enthusiastic English tutor and a Stanford University graduate.<br>- Softly spoken Susan from Singapore:  She is an avid reader and also boasts a top-class education. <br>- Alejandro from Spain:  He\u2019s an English tutor and a culinary enthusiast, which means you can ask him anything about tapas! <br>- Marco from the USA: He\u2019s an English tutor, a journalist and an outdoor enthusiast.<br>- Charlie - a charming English tutor from London. She\u2019s also an art lover and former journalist.<br><br>....and many others.<br><br>LEARN ABOUT <br>Architecture, art, business, car brands, cinema, cuisine, dance, economics, <br>education, entrepreneurship, environmental issues, famous landmarks, fashion, festivals, film, food, football rivalries, the football World Cup, geography, health care, history, immigration, influencers, literature, museums, music, natural wonders, Netflix, pop culture, Queen Elizabeth II, careers in I.T, relationships, finance, beauty, social media, fitness, transport, startups, new technologies, science, domestic animals, jobs and career, shopping, street art, technology, theatre tourism, tv shows, UFC, wildlife and many more\u2026<br><br>So what are you waiting for? Start your English language learning journey today with Praktika \u2013 the most practical and fun way to learn English!<br><br>If you have any questions or need assistance, our team is always here to help. Simply reach out to us at support@praktika.ai.<br><br>Download Praktika today and join new era of English learners. <br><br>Terms of Use: https://praktika.ai/terms<br>Privacy Policy: https://praktika.ai/privacy",
